# TILTSHOT design test: Toss-Up's odds. The par-1 hole is "aim and pray": a
# full shot over the pit at 45 degrees goes in only when it slips between
# the four juggling hop-bots. Swung at every moment of their round it goes
# in between a tenth and three tenths of the time, with gaps of well over
# ten frames for a player who watches them; the aims either side are worse.
# Then the real thing from the tee: full power, timed through a gap.
seed 18
game tiltshot
wait 5
cheat timing 9 9 60
expect timing_pct >= 10
expect timing_pct <= 30
expect timing_run >= 12
cheat timing 9 8 60
expect timing_pct < 20
cheat timing 9 10 60
expect timing_pct < 20
# with real presses: the demo player's route is a timed full shot
cheat hole 9
botuntil holed == 1 3000
expect strokes == 1
expect sunk_diff == 0
